> Converted from personal notes. Amounts are for one serving. Directions are editorial, not verified source instructions.

> Comparable recipe only (not original): https://www.eatingbirdfood.com/blueberry-overnight-oats/

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @almond milk{1/5%cup}, @blueberries{12}, @certified gluten-free overnight oats{1%cup}, @organic maple syrup{1%tsp}, @almonds{1%tsp}, @chia seeds{1%tsp}, @sugar{1%tsp}.

== Preparation ==

Combine the certified gluten-free oat preparation, almond milk, chia, maple syrup and sugar. Refrigerate covered overnight if using uncooked oats; verify whether the saved overnight-oats ingredient is an already prepared product. Top with blueberries and almonds.
